    {
      "name": "places/ChIJM6n_r-PtaS4RCjqKX1aqdb0/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMzaS0ySEFREAE",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a year ago",
      "rating": 2,
      "text": {
        "text": "I ordered Zuppa soup but the soup was only a quarter of the cup height. The waitress said that’s the standard quantity. Ok fine, but it was not soupy at all. It was a solid thing and I even could knock and crack it. The waitress said she would re-heat the soup. However it still ended up with a lumpy texture that didn’t interest me at all to try it.\n\nOh and there was a dead cockroach on the floor nearby our table🤢",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
